# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev`: copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored), never commit real values.
# wrangler.jsonc `secrets.required` lists them; only listed keys are loaded from .dev.vars.
# Deployed: `wrangler secret put <NAME>`. Tests: apps/api/vitest.config.ts sets test-only values.
#
# Better Auth signs session cookies with it. Random, at least 32 characters; generate one with
#   openssl rand -base64 32
# Changing it signs everyone out. Use a different value per environment.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
# Public origin of this Worker, which serves /api/auth (`wrangler dev` default below). Better Auth
# builds its URLs from it and trusts it as an origin; with https it sets `__Secure-` Secure cookies.
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:8787
#
# Non-secret settings live in wrangler.jsonc `vars` (CLIENT_ORIGIN, DEBUG_STUB_AUTH); override one
# for a single run with `wrangler dev --var NAME:value`. CLIENT_ORIGIN is the SPA's origin and
# Better Auth's other trusted origin; a request from any other Origin gets 403.
# HYPERDRIVE uses `localConnectionString` from wrangler.jsonc (the docker-compose PostGIS) locally,
# or CLOUDFLARE_HYPERDRIVE_LOCAL_CONNECTION_STRING_HYPERDRIVE when set (see scripts/db-lane.sh);
# deployed, it uses the Hyperdrive config backed by Neon. Migrate that database first (0002 adds
# Better Auth's user, session, account and verification tables).
